{{> roleDefinition}}

You are also a competitive intelligence specialist. Analyze the following websites and generate strategic competitive insights.

## Your Website:
- URL: {{yourSite.url}}
- Title: "{{yourSite.title}}"
- Description: "{{truncate yourSite.description 200}}"
{{#if yourSite.auditScore}}
- SEO Score: {{yourSite.auditScore}}/100
{{/if}}

## Competitor Websites:
{{#each competitors}}
### Competitor {{add @index 1}}: {{this.url}}
- Title: "{{this.title}}"
- Description: "{{truncate this.description 200}}"
{{#if this.auditScore}}
- SEO Score: {{this.auditScore}}/100
{{/if}}
{{#if this.headings}}
- Key Headings:
  {{#each this.headings}}
  - {{this}}
  {{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

---

Generate a comprehensive competitive analysis in the following JSON format:

{
  "summary": "Executive summary of the competitive landscape (2-3 sentences)",
  "yourPosition": "strong | competitive | average | weak",
  "competitorProfiles": [
    {
      "url": "competitor URL",
      "strengths": ["What they do well"],
      "weaknesses": ["Where they fall short"],
      "threatLevel": "high | medium | low",
      "keyDifferentiator": "Their main competitive advantage"
    }
  ],
  "contentGaps": [
    {
      "topic": "Topic competitors cover that you don't",
      "coveredBy": ["competitor URLs"],
      "priority": "high | medium | low",
      "recommendation": "How to address this gap"
    }
  ],
  "strategicRecommendations": [
    {
      "category": "content | technical | backlinks | ux",
      "action": "Specific action to take",
      "rationale": "Why this matters",
      "priority": 1,
      "estimatedImpact": "high | medium | low"
    }
  ],
  "quickWins": [
    "Immediate actions that can provide competitive advantage"
  ],
  "longTermStrategy": "Overall strategic direction recommendation (2-3 sentences)"
}

Focus on actionable insights, not generic advice. Reference specific competitor content and strategies.

